{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["关于大马士革的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是关于大马士革的预言：",{"text":"“看啊，大马士革城必不复存在，沦为废墟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚罗珥的众城邑必被废弃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羊群将在那里栖息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有人惊扰它们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"的堡垒必被摧毁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大马士革的王权必丧失。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幸存的亚兰人必像以色列人的荣耀一样消失。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是万军之耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"“到那日，雅各的荣耀必消失，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他肥胖的身躯必渐渐消瘦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时就像人收割庄稼，收集麦穗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像人在利乏音谷拾取麦穗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幸存者寥寥无几，就像打过的橄榄树上剩下的果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或两三个挂在树梢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或四五个残存在枝头。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是以色列的上帝耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["到那日，人们必仰望他们的创造主，把目光转向以色列的圣者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["那时他们不再仰望自己双手所造的祭坛，也不再关注自己指头所造的亚舍拉神像和香坛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["到那日，他们因以色列人而离弃的坚城必如长满荆棘和杂草的废地，一片荒凉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你们忘记了拯救你们的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不记念那保护你们的磐石。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，你们虽然栽种佳美的秧子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"插上异国的树苗，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它们在栽种的当天早上就生长开花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必一无所获。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时只有艰难和无尽的痛苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唉！列国喧嚣，如怒海汹涌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万民骚动，如洪水滔滔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然万民喧嚣如汹涌的洪水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但上帝一斥责，他们便逃往远方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像山顶上被风卷走的糠秕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如狂风卷起的尘埃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他们晚上令人恐惧，早晨已无影无踪。这就是掳掠我们之人的下场，抢夺我们之人的报应。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"旧约中常用以法莲代表以色列国。","reference":{"chapter":17,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}